---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — A Builder's Odyssey"
  description="Craig Dubé builds local AI agents on one Mac mini and writes down what happens."
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="masthead">
      <p class="eyebrow">A Builder&rsquo;s Odyssey</p>
      <h1>About</h1>
      <hr class="rule" />
    </header>

    <section class="col">
      <p>
        I&rsquo;m Craig Dubé. I build small AI agents that run on my own
        hardware &mdash; a Mac mini with an M4 Pro and 48&nbsp;GB of unified
        memory &mdash; and I write down what happens.
      </p>
      <p>
        The posts here are working notes rather than tutorials. Each one
        follows a single problem through to whatever it actually measured,
        including the parts that got slower.
      </p>
      <p>
        Code lives at <a href="https://github.com/cjdube">github.com/cjdube</a>.
        The archive of these posts is also on
        <a href="https://medium.com/a-builders-odyssey">Medium</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
